      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Services by coverage state",
      "description": "Coverage: unsupported = no adapter; planned = extension point only, no telemetry; unmonitored = adapter not enabled; degraded = stale/failing (also when the discovery record is older than 1 h); monitored = enabled and fresh. The console/API also checks collector staleness per telemetry source. Rows come from v_services (one row per service, FINAL).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource",
        "uid": "extorq-clickhouse"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
